# /home/profile/start.ns — kitty's namespace, in `namespace(6)`'s format,
# added to the system's at login (`addns`, docs/packages.md) — so their binds
# come after, and win over, /profile/start.ns. Plan 9's users make theirs in
# `$home/lib/profile`, as rc commands. Theirs to change.

# the packages installed to this user, as `pkg` binds them
. /home/profile/pkg.ns
